# Terraform
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc

# Secret-bearing variable files (non-secret terraform.tfvars is committed)
*.secret.tfvars
secrets.auto.tfvars

# Local shell env (e.g. direnv's .envrc holding HCLOUD_TOKEN — Read Only
# only, per AGENTS.md; never the Read & Write token)
.envrc
.env

# OS/editor cruft
.DS_Store
*.swp

# Ansible: Galaxy-installed role/collection content (fetched via
# `ansible-galaxy install -r ansible/requirements.yml`), pinned by exact
# version in that file, not committed itself.
ansible/roles/geerlingguy.docker/
